    "僅列出與主訂單同幣別 (%@)、同客戶「%@」的訂單；選擇後會以兩筆訂單整合的資料開啟確認表單。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Only orders in the same currency (%@) and for the same customer, “%@”, are shown. After selection, a confirmation form opens with the combined order data."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "僅列出與主訂單同幣別 (%1$@)、同客戶「%2$@」的訂單；選擇後會以兩筆訂單整合的資料開啟確認表單。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "僅能與同幣別、同客戶且非「已合併」「已取消」的訂單合併。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Orders can only be merged when they use the same currency, belong to the same customer, and are neither merged nor canceled."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "僅能與同幣別、同客戶且非「已合併」「已取消」的訂單合併。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
